 "sentences": [
  "Meet the banksia with hidden red lanterns.",
  "Banksia caleyi is a dense, 2 m shrub native to Western Australia.",
  "Its red flowers hang downwards, typically hiding inside the foliage.",
  "Robert Brown first described this plant back in 1830.",
  "Periodic bushfires kill the plants, but they regenerate from seeds afterwards.",
  "Unlike most relatives, it resists deadly soil-borne water mould, making it easy to grow."
